# Aide's memory budget: the service and its call voice (aide-voice.service) together. Loading the voice models peaks
# at a few GB each; without a cap, a restart on top of other work took cappa into swap until it froze (2026-11-07).
# Past MemoryHigh the kernel reclaims; past MemoryMax it kills inside the slice (systemd restarts it), never outside.
# Install: README.md, "Running as a service".
[Unit]
Description=Aide and its voice

[Slice]
MemoryHigh=7G
MemoryMax=8G
MemorySwapMax=1G
